      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A light staff</i> or <i>stick with which a beast
of carriage is urged on.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A stick,</i> or
<i>wooden instrument, with which wool is teased,</i>
or <i>separated, i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْدَفٌ</span> (?) (TA,) <i>and with which
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقِيبَة</span> <i>of a camel's saddle is stuffed.</i> (K, TA.)

